flowchart TD
    A[Main Menu] -->|Start Game| B[Create New Run]
    B --> C[Stage 1-1 Normal Combat]
    C --> D{Combat Result}
    D -->|Victory| E[Apply Rewards]
    D -->|Defeat| F{Player Choice}
    F -->|Retry| C
    F -->|Abandon Run| A
    E --> G[Route Selection]
    G --> H{Selected Node Type}
    H -->|Combat| I[Normal Combat]
    H -->|Event| J[Resolve Event]
    H -->|Reward| K[Grant Reward]
    H -->|Shop| L[Open Shop]
    I --> M{Combat Result}
    M -->|Victory| N[Apply Rewards and Progression]
    M -->|Defeat| O{Player Choice}
    O -->|Retry| I
    O -->|Abandon Run| A
    J --> P[Advance Stage]
    K --> P
    L --> P
    N --> P
    P --> Q{Stage 1-5 Reached?}
    Q -->|No| G
    Q -->|Yes| R[Boss Combat]
    R --> S{Boss Result}
    S -->|Victory| T[Run Complete]
    S -->|Defeat and Retry| R
    S -->|Abandon Run| A
    T -->|Return to Main Menu| A
